<title>ESTONIA: EVEA JUNE PROFIT 1.4 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>EVEA JUNE PROFIT 1.4 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>EVEA Pank said on Thursday its June profit was 1.4 million kroons compared to 1.2 million kroons in May.</p>
<p>EVEA Pank's current year profit was 7.5 million kroons which is 50 percent of its 1997 profit estimate of 15 million kroons, it added in a statement.  </p>
<p>Its assets rose 141.8 million kroons or 36.4 percent in six months to 531.6 million kroons.</p>
<p>In June, deposits grew 1.3 million kroons to 380 million kroons. Loan portfolio grew 15.3 million kroons to 245 million kroons.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
